        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix incorrect inheritance description for Range interface]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42707</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42707"/>
        <updated>2026-01-09T12:42:28.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47806934?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Corrected the inheritance information for the <code class="notranslate">Range</code> interface.<br>
This change updates it to reflect that <code class="notranslate">Range</code> inherits from the <code class="notranslate">AbstractRange</code> interface.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The previous documentation was inconsistent with the DOM specification and other MDN pages, such as <code class="notranslate">StaticRange</code>.<br>
Fixing this helps readers understand the correct inheritance hierarchy and ensures MDN remains accurate and reliable.</p>
