        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Ff148 tt asyncfunction generatorfunction]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42697</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42697"/>
        <updated>2026-01-09T00:51:16.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">The <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/AsyncFunction/AsyncFunction" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">AsyncFunction()</code></a>, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/GeneratorFunction/GeneratorFunction" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">GeneratorFunction()</code></a>, and <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/AsyncGeneratorFunction/AsyncGeneratorFunction" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">AsyncGeneratorFunction()</code></a> contructors can execute their arguments as JavaScript.</p>
<p dir="auto">These are subclasses of <code class="notranslate">Function()</code>, which is documented in</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3746186429" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42462" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42462/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42462">#42462</a> (this PR depends on it)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">What this does is:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Add the three functions to the list of injection sinks</li>
<li>Add the warning header and a comment to the examples section for each. These link to the <code class="notranslate">Function()</code> security section and exmples.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">IMO this is sufficient.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3510273732" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41507/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41507">#41507</a></p>]]></content>
